{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.hinana.juice",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "站台等电车，她说想喝果汁",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.hinana.juice",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.hinana.juice",
    "idolId": "hinana",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "……电车，还不来呢～？",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "好像刚走了一班，要等挺久的。",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "这样啊～……",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "工作日的午后是这种感觉啊～",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "总觉得，挺好的～……",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………今天抱歉了，雛菜。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我尽量不把工作安排在学校的时间……",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "嗯～？没关系哦～",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "今天是体育课的长跑嘛。啊哈～只有雛菜赚到了的感觉♡",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……像这样请假的事，以后也不能说完全没有。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "所以能去学校的时候，要好好上课啊？",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "嘿～……？嗯～……",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "啊！制作人，雛菜想喝果汁～？",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "喂，别岔开话题。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "诶～，可是雛菜是请假了来工作的哦？",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "有点幸福～的事也可以有吧～！",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………嘛，这么说也是……",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "呀哈～♡决定了！雛菜选哪个好呢～……！",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "白桃、草莓……啊，还有樱桃～！",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "呐，制作人要哪一个～？",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不，我──……",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "那就雛菜桃子～制作人樱桃哦？",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "喂，雛菜……",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "麻烦您～♡桃子和樱桃各一个～",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "啊哈～～～",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "在大家跑长跑的时候喝的果汁，特别不一样呢～～～♡",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……雛菜，我们不是来玩的啊？",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "嗯～……不过雛菜，果然还是樱桃比较好。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶？",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "桃子也好喝，可是～～～……",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "总觉得制作人那份看起来更好喝～",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……是吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "嗯～，所以呢？制作人。",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "给我一口～～～？",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "──啊～已经没有了～……",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "………………",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "呐，制作人，要是雛菜她们变得超有人气～",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "像这样喝果汁～、坐电车～，就做不到了吗～？",
        "nextNodeId": "40"
      },
      "40": {
        "id": "40",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯——，是啊……也许吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "41"
      },
      "41": {
        "id": "41",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "在学校也会被搭话呢～",
        "nextNodeId": "42"
      },
      "42": {
        "id": "42",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "雛菜不太认识学校里的人，会变成『谁～？』那种……",
        "nextNodeId": "43"
      },
      "43": {
        "id": "43",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………雛菜。",
        "nextNodeId": "44"
      },
      "44": {
        "id": "44",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "以后这样的事也许会变多。",
        "nextNodeId": "45"
      },
      "45": {
        "id": "45",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "所以那种时候──……",
        "nextNodeId": "46"
      },
      "46": {
        "id": "46",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "……话是这么说，说不定雛菜她们根本不会有人气呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "47"
      },
      "47": {
        "id": "47",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶……不，不会那样的──",
        "nextNodeId": "48"
      },
      "48": {
        "id": "48",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "啊哈～嘛，算了～",
        "nextNodeId": "49"
      },
      "49": {
        "id": "49",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "只是周围自己变了而已，雛菜并不会变成不是雛菜。",
        "nextNodeId": "50"
      },
      "50": {
        "id": "50",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "不过制作人，希望你不要变得太多呢～……",
        "nextNodeId": "51"
      },
      "51": {
        "id": "51",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "52"
      },
      "52": {
        "id": "52",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "呐，下次再来这里，就喝别的味道吧～？",
        "nextNodeId": "53"
      },
      "53": {
        "id": "53",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "嗯～……电车，还不来呢～……"
      }
    }
  },
